{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Choreographing Destruction Layers.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Choreographing Destruction Layers.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"choreographing destruction layers choreographing destruction layers","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Choreographing Destruction Layers.md","fileName":"Choreographing Destruction Layers.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Choreographing Destruction Layers","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-15 18:17\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[Particle and Destruction VFX]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Particle and Destruction VFX","Rigid Body Fracture and Collision","Geometry-Instanced Particle Debris","digitalvisualeffectsandcompositing.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Choreographing Destruction Layers.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Choreographing Destruction Layers.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"choreographing destruction layers choreographing destruction layers","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Choreographing Destruction Layers.md","fileName":"Choreographing Destruction Layers.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Choreographing Destruction Layers","heading":"Choreographing Destruction Layers","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"A convincing digital explosion is a timed relationship among fractured structural pieces, fire and smoke, expelled interior debris, and surviving damaged material. The book compares this to a practical set explosion whose different charges are fired in sequence. Showing a whole model until destruction, then swapping to fractured geometry, prevents premature gaps. Fire footage on depth-staged cards can sit behind, between, and in front of fragments; particle-driven debris suggests contents that were inside the destroyed object. See [[Rigid Body Fracture and Collision]] and [[Geometry-Instanced Particle Debris]].","tags":["baby"],"links":["Particle and Destruction VFX","Rigid Body Fracture and Collision","Geometry-Instanced Particle Debris","digitalvisualeffectsandcompositing.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Choreographing Destruction Layers.md::2","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Choreographing Destruction Layers.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"choreographing destruction layers choreographing destruction layers","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Choreographing Destruction Layers.md","fileName":"Choreographing Destruction Layers.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Choreographing Destruction Layers","heading":"References","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"[[digitalvisualeffectsandcompositing.pdf]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Particle and Destruction VFX","Rigid Body Fracture and Collision","Geometry-Instanced Particle Debris","digitalvisualeffectsandcompositing.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""}]}